            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nYeah, indeed can reproduce. I think the best approach here is to have all `jump_*` steps themselves ensure that there is no pmenu visible. And indeed it should reuse the `H.hide_completion` from 'mini.snippets'. Are you interested in making PR for this?",
